// =============================================================================
// Chora Transaction History Service (gRPC) — Contextual Transaction History
// =============================================================================
//
// Source-of-truth: docs/architecture/adrs/adr-208-contextual-transaction-history.md
//   + docs/CONTEXTUAL-TRANSACTION-HISTORY-PLAN-2026-06-29.md (sec 3, 4, 7 row A1)
//   + .claude/rules/ddd-enforcement.md
//
// Read surface for the unified, per-scope transaction ledger (ADR-208). The
// ledger is a CQRS read projection (`transaction_ledger`) owned by the
// Tenancy + Billing domain (chora_tenancy database), event-fed from
// chora_payments / chora_identity (user_mana) / chora_observability
// (token_usage) — see the A2 source-event protos. Cross-DB queries are
// FORBIDDEN; the projection NEVER joins those DBs, it subscribes to their
// events. This service only READS the projection.
//
// One contract serves all three ADR-208 scopes (D1), each mapped to an
// EXISTING isolation mechanism — scope is explicit, never an accident of the
// roles a JWT happens to carry:
//   - LEARNER (A+ /a/transactions)  — own GCID, RLS by learner_gcid.
//   - TENANT  (H+ /h/transactions)  — own tenant, set chora.tenant_id GUC.
//   - MASTER  (= PLATFORM_OPERATOR, ADR-165) — cross-franchisee span-all via
//     WithRLSBypass(ctx) + mandatory governance audit BEFORE SQL, OR a single
//     franchisee via TransactionFilters.managed_tenant_id.
//
// The caller's binding identity (learner_gcid for LEARNER, tenant_id for
// TENANT) is injected server-side from the authenticated ChoraSession — it is
// NOT client-supplied. The only identity-shaped request fields are the
// deliberate operator/admin choices managed_tenant_id (MASTER selector)
// and the learner_gcid drill filter (TENANT/MASTER).
//
// Deployed in chora-tenancy (Team 3 / Platform). mTLS via Cloud Service Mesh;
// SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in gRPC metadata. The
// chora-gateway BFF fronts this with the REST surface in
// openapi/transaction-history.yaml (learner /me + admin /admin).
//
// Per ADR-208 ACCEPTED 2026-06-29 — supersedes the payments-admin
// ListPurchaseHistory read path (CHO-1931 won't-fix).
// =============================================================================

